WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
We used to go to Herăstrău Park all the
time with my parents, every single Sunday,

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:07.950
and I'd ride my bike or go rollerblading.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.950
Sometimes we'd take out a pedal boat
too, but mostly we just rode our bikes.

4
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.950
Going to Herăstrău on a
Sunday was a family tradition,

5
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:27.950
and we always stopped for snacks:
popcorn, spiral potatoes, ice cream.

6
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.950
That was my favourite
thing when I was little.

7
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.950
I'd also go to Herăstrău with
my grandma and all my cousins.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:37.950
There were five of us, and she was
babysitting four other kids as well.

9
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.950
We always went out on the pedal boats,
except we all piled in together,

10
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:46.950
because she couldn't afford two,
so we all squeezed onto just one.

11
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.971
Over the years, I think what's
changed most is the people.

12
00:00:51.021 --> 00:00:52.950
They don't come to the parks as often.

13
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:57.715
You don't see nearly as many people in
the parks as you did ten years ago, when I

14
00:00:57.765 --> 00:00:58.950
came with my parents.

15
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.950
What would you improve
in the parks around here?

16
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:06.950
The cycle lanes. You can barely
see the markings any more.

17
00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:12.950
And the pedal boat area. I don't
think it's been done up in years.

